  "engineExpressible": true,
  "expectClean": true,
  "engineGap": null,
  "engineNotes": "match.groupSum, many = left. Price is a block field, so the engine does not sum it. There is no sum tolerance; the sums are exact. Fill counts are 2 to 6, under the group cap of 16. A block that omits OrderId can exceed the default maxBlockItems of 24. The left row key is FillId, not OrderId: duplicate order ids on the fills are not row-key conflicts.",
